From 617e6dbcdaacf25db7caeec63e2f2206072797fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:02:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 36/41] Section launch learned to a CC survives loading the
 song (upstream 95b7acab)

Song files keep a section's launch command with its channelOrZone, which for a learned CC is
the channel + IS_A_CC. Loading took only plain channels (below 16), so the CC was dropped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Eb214cM1zi1k5Gpcn9RLKh
---
 src/deluge/model/song/song.cpp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/deluge/model/song/song.cpp b/src/deluge/model/song/song.cpp
index a61716e3..98992e84 100644
--- a/src/deluge/model/song/song.cpp
+++ b/src/deluge/model/song/song.cpp
@@ -1887,7 +1887,10 @@ unknownTag:
 						}
 
 						if (id < kMaxNumSections) {
-							if (channel < 16 && note < 128) {
+							// A plain channel (0-15), an MPE zone (16-17) or, for a learned CC, channel + IS_A_CC
+							// (see LearnedMIDI::channelOrZone). 1.2.1 took only the first, so a section launch learned
+							// to a CC was gone after loading the song (upstream 95b7acab)
+							if (channel < IS_A_PC && note < 128) {
 								sections[id].launchMIDICommand.device = device;
 								sections[id].launchMIDICommand.channelOrZone = channel;
 								sections[id].launchMIDICommand.noteOrCC = note;
